    "prompt": "A large storage box recently donated to the school craft room contains exactly 45 marbles in total, sorted ready for a class art project. 3 out of every 5 marbles in that box are blue, and every remaining marble is red. How many individual marbles inside the box are blue?",
    "options": [],
    "visuals": [],
    "answerKey": {
      "kind": "number",
      "value": 27,
      "tolerance": 0
    },
    "explanation": "To find three-fifths of 45, first divide 45 by 5 to find one-fifth, which is 9. Multiplying 9 by 3 gives 27, so there are 27 blue marbles.",
